---
import LiveBanner from "../../components/LiveBanner.astro";
import PageFooter from "../../components/PageFooter.astro";
---

<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer" />
  <title>How to organize a REAL eco-friendly event in the Caribbean — countdowns.co</title>
  <meta name="description" content="A practical Caribbean playbook: the 5 dimensions of a genuinely low-impact festival — emissions, waste, water, biodiversity, community — with concrete steps and local partners." />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://caribbean.countdowns.co/blog/organize-eco-friendly-event/" />
  <meta property="og:type" content="article" />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://caribbean.countdowns.co/blog/organize-eco-friendly-event/" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="How to organize a REAL eco-friendly event in the Caribbean — countdowns.co" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="A practical Caribbean playbook: the 5 dimensions of a genuinely low-impact festival — emissions, waste, water, biodiversity, community." />
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://caribbean.countdowns.co/images/og-eco-organize.webp" />
  <meta property="og:image:width" content="1200" />
  <meta property="og:image:height" content="630" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
  <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://caribbean.countdowns.co/images/og-eco-organize.webp" />
  <style>.t-fr{display:none}.lang-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px}</style>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body { background: #0f0f0f; color: #e0e0e0; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; min-height: 100vh; }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    .page { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 24px 80px; }
    .header-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .site-title { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.3px; color: #fff; }
    .back-link { font-size: 13px; color: #888; }
    .back-link:hover { color: #ccc; }
    .lang-group { display: flex; gap: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .lang-btn { background: transparent; border: 1px solid #555; border-radius: 3px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 18px; padding: 2px 6px; color: #aaa; font-family: inherit; transition: all 0.15s; opacity: 0.75; }
    .lang-btn:hover { border-color: #888; opacity: 0.8; }
    .lang-btn.active { background: #1a1a1a; border-color: #555; opacity: 1; }
    .divider { border: none; border-top: 1px solid #2a2a2a; margin: 24px 0 32px; }
    .post-meta { font-size: 12px; color: #999999; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    h2 { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; line-height: 1.3; margin-bottom: 12px; letter-spacing: -0.3px; }
    h3 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #5eead4; margin: 32px 0 10px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
    .intro { font-size: 15px; color: #bbb; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    p { color: #aaa; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .cta { background: #101d1a; border: 1px solid #0d9488; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px 24px; margin: 28px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #bbb; }
    .cta a { color: #5eead4; font-weight: 700; }
    .dims { list-style: none; margin: 8px 0 0; }
    .dim { display: block; background: #161616; border: 1px solid #2a2a2a; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 12px; transition: border-color 0.15s; }
    a.dim:hover { border-color: #0d9488; text-decoration: none; }
    .dim-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }
    .dim-title .dim-icon { margin-right: 8px; }
    .dim-desc { font-size: 13px; color: #999; margin: 4px 0 0; }
    .dim-soon { font-size: 11px; color: #999999; border: 1px solid #333; border-radius: 20px; padding: 1px 8px; margin-left: 8px; vertical-align: middle; }
    .dim-read { font-size: 12px; color: #0d9488; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 8px; display: inline-block; }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
<LiveBanner />
  <main class="page">

    <div class="header-row">
      <h1 class="site-title"><a href="/">Countdowns</a></h1>
      <div class="lang-row">
        <a class="back-link" href="/blog/">
          <span class="t-en">← Blog</span>
          <span class="t-fr">← Blog</span>
        </a>
        <div class="lang-group">
          <button class="lang-btn" data-lang="en">EN</button>
          <button class="lang-btn" data-lang="fr">FR</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="divider" />

    <div class="post-meta">
      <span class="t-en">July 2026 · mongoose author</span>
      <span class="t-fr">Juillet 2026 · auteur/autrice mangouste</span>
    </div>

    <h2>
      <span class="t-en">How to organize a REAL eco-friendly event in the Caribbean</span>
      <span class="t-fr">Comment organiser un événement VRAIMENT éco-responsable dans la Caraïbe</span>
    </h2>

    <p class="intro">
      <span class="t-en">Most "green event" claims are marketing — a reusable-cup photo and a hashtag. A genuinely low-impact festival is measured across five dimensions, not one. In the Caribbean the stakes are higher: island isolation makes some emissions unavoidable and venues often sit metres from coral reefs, mangroves and turtle-nesting beaches.</span>
      <span class="t-fr">La plupart des promesses d'« événement vert » relèvent du marketing — une photo de gobelet réutilisable et un hashtag. L'impact sur l'environnement se mesure sur cinq dimensions, pas une seule. Dans la Caraïbe, les enjeux sont plus élevés : l'isolement insulaire rend en effet certaines émissions inévitables, et les sites se trouvent souvent à quelques mètres de récifs coralliens, de mangroves et de plages de ponte des tortues.</span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span class="t-en">This is a practical playbook: what you can do in each dimension and — crucially — which local partners and services can make it happen. It's the companion to our free interactive scorecard.</span>
      <span class="t-fr">Voici un guide pratique qui liste ce qu'il faut réellement faire dans chaque dimension et — surtout — avec quels partenaires et services locaux vous pouvez y arriver. C'est le complément de notre grille d'évaluation interactive gratuite.</span>
    </p>

    <div class="cta">
      <span class="t-en">👉 Start by measuring your event — the <a href="/eco-evaluator/">free eco-evaluator</a> scores you across all five dimensions in two minutes.</span>
      <span class="t-fr">👉 Commencez par évaluer votre événement — l'<a href="/eco-evaluator/">évaluateur éco gratuit</a> vous note sur les cinq dimensions en deux minutes.</span>
    </div>

    <h3>
      <span class="t-en">The five dimensions</span>
      <span class="t-fr">Les cinq dimensions</span>
    </h3>

    <ul class="dims">
      <li>
        <a class="dim" href="/blog/eco-events-emissions/">
          <div class="dim-title"><span class="dim-icon">💨</span>
            <span class="t-en">Emissions</span><span class="t-fr">Émissions</span>
          </div>
          <p class="dim-desc">
            <span class="t-en">Shared attendee transport, renewable energy, low-carbon catering, regional artists, offsets. The biggest single lever lives here.</span>
            <span class="t-fr">Transport partagé du public, énergie renouvelable, restauration bas-carbone, artistes régionaux, compensation. Le plus grand levier est ici.</span>
          </p>
          <span class="dim-read"><span class="t-en">Read the guide →</span><span class="t-fr">Lire le guide →</span></span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <div class="dim">
          <div class="dim-title"><span class="dim-icon">♻️</span>
            <span class="t-en">Waste</span><span class="t-fr">Déchets</span>
            <span class="dim-soon"><span class="t-en">coming soon</span><span class="t-fr">bientôt</span></span>
          </div>
          <p class="dim-desc">
            <span class="t-en">Single-use plastic bans, on-site sorting, reusable cups, composting, published waste data.</span>
            <span class="t-fr">Interdiction du plastique à usage unique, tri sur site, gobelets réutilisables, compostage, publication des données de vos déchets.</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <div class="dim">
          <div class="dim-title"><span class="dim-icon">💧</span>
            <span class="t-en">Water</span><span class="t-fr">Eau</span>
            <span class="dim-soon"><span class="t-en">coming soon</span><span class="t-fr">bientôt</span></span>
          </div>
          <p class="dim-desc">
            <span class="t-en">Refill stations, no bottled water, consumption tracking, wastewater plan, drought awareness.</span>
            <span class="t-fr">Fontaines à eau, pas de bouteilles, suivi de la consommation, plan des eaux usées, sensibilisation à la sécheresse.</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <div class="dim">
          <div class="dim-title"><span class="dim-icon">🐢</span>
            <span class="t-en">Biodiversity</span><span class="t-fr">Biodiversité</span>
            <span class="dim-soon"><span class="t-en">coming soon</span><span class="t-fr">bientôt</span></span>
          </div>
          <p class="dim-desc">
            <span class="t-en">Distance from protected areas, wildlife briefings, leave-no-trace, light-pollution control, eco NGO onboarding.</span>
            <span class="t-fr">Distance des zones protégées, sensibilisation à la faune, ne laisser aucune trace, maîtrise de la pollution lumineuse, integration d'une ONG écologique.</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <div class="dim">
          <div class="dim-title"><span class="dim-icon">🤝</span>
            <span class="t-en">Community</span><span class="t-fr">Communauté</span>
            <span class="dim-soon"><span class="t-en">coming soon</span><span class="t-fr">bientôt</span></span>
          </div>
          <p class="dim-desc">
            <span class="t-en">Local vendors and line-up, NGO partnership, accessible pricing, social inclusion.</span>
            <span class="t-fr">Prestataires et programmation locaux, partenariat avec une ONG locale, tarifs accessibles, inclusion sociale.</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="cta">
      <span class="t-en">Every dimension in the scorecard links back here. Score your event, then work through the guides. <a href="/eco-evaluator/">Open the evaluator →</a> Not sure it's worth it? Read <a href="/blog/why-organize-eco-friendly-event/">why eco-friendly events pay off →</a></span>
      <span class="t-fr">Chaque dimension de la grille renvoie ici. Évaluez votre événement, puis parcourez les guides. <a href="/eco-evaluator/">Ouvrir l'évaluateur →</a> Pas convaincu·e ? Lisez <a href="/blog/why-organize-eco-friendly-event/">pourquoi les événements éco-responsables raportent →</a></span>
    </div>

  </main>

  <script is:inline src="/scripts/lang.js" defer></script>
<PageFooter />
</body>
</html>
